  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- Riders on the Storm is sandwiched inside Meet Me at the Creek, which returns after it, following Pyramid Country [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **billystrings2017-11-11t01**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **billystrings2017-11-11t02**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **billystrings2017-11-11t03**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **billystrings2017-11-11t04**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **billystrings2017-11-11t05**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **billystrings2017-11-11t06**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **billystrings2017-11-11t07**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **billystrings2017-11-11t08**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2017-11-11.sbd.flac16** (recommended): soundboard; 16 songs; 100 min; rated 4.67/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Silas Herman guested on four songs: Me & My Uncle, My Sweet Blue Eyed Darlin', Big Mon and Wild Bill Jones [2]\n- Listener believes Drew played mandolin alongside Billy at this show, though they sound unsure [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2017-11-11.sbd.flac16**: taped by Ken Tredway; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: soundboard>SD722 [1]. Also: Recorded on an SD722, edited in Sound Forge Pro 11 with fades, iZotope sample-rate conversion and dithering down to 16-bit/44.1kHz; After editing, tracked in CDWAV and encoded to FLAC with Trader's Little Helper [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Bluebird Theater - Denver, CO - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/bluebird-theater-denver-co/) [6]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Bluebird Theater - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/bluebird-theater/) [7]",
